    "description": {
      "summary": "The Rumtifusel is the most elusive of all fearsome critters, defined entirely by what cannot be known about it.",
      "full": "The Rumtifusel is the most elusive of all fearsome critters, defined entirely by what cannot be known about it. This creature moves with such incredible speed that it has never been clearly observed. Witnesses report only a blur, a rush of wind, perhaps a fleeting shadow—but nothing definitive. Because no one has ever gotten a good look at the Rumtifusel, no reliable description exists. Is it large or small? Furred or scaled? Four-legged or two? No one knows, because by the time you notice it, it's already gone."
    },
